# Dev-machine-only symlink to the sibling Training repo (server/api.js's
# MANUAL_DIR) — committing the symlink itself broke every fresh checkout's
# `vite build` (Vite's public-dir copy stats it and finds no such target on
# any machine other than the one that created it, CI included). Each
# developer who wants the manual viewer creates their own local symlink;
# server/api.js already degrades gracefully (empty nav tree) without one.
public/manual

